        <div id="ratios" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">
            6. Rice Types, Rinsing and Water Ratios
          </h2>

          <p>
            The ratios below are for cooking in a rice cooker after rinsing, using the machine's own measuring cup. If you are using a basic on/off cooker, getting these right is the whole game, because the machine cannot correct for you.
          </p>

          <div class="overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl my-8">
            <table class="w-full text-left">
              <thead class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
                <tr>
